ting protocols. PRISM is the diagnostic algebra (measures loops over time). PULSE is the temporal algebra (declares how loops cycle). OS-011 (Embodiment) is the sensorimotor behavioral protocol for "},{"id":"spn-105488","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.*"},{"id":"spn-105489","text":" providers — closes the perception-action gap by defining the typed "},{"id":"spn-105490","marks":["code"],"text":"perceive/act/affordances/encode_state/replay"},{"id":"spn-105491","text":" loop. Together with the eight cognitive primitives (OS-001 through OS-008) and the [&] structural composition layer, they form the complete protocol stack."}]},{"id":"blk-72547","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105492","text":"Separate spec documents"}]},{"id":"blk-72548","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105493","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md"},{"id":"spn-105494","text":" — Agent Harness Protocol (pipeline enforcement, quality gates, sprint contracts, context management)"}]}],"id":"blk-72549","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105495","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION.md"},{"id":"spn-105496","text":" — PRISM Protocol for Rating Iterative System Memory (9 CL dimensions, 4-phase evaluation loop, BYOR, IRT calibration)"}]}],"id":"blk-72551","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105497","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION.md"},{"id":"spn-105498","text":" — PULSE Protocol for Uniform Loop State Exchange (loop manifest schema, 5 canonical phase kinds, 6 canonical tokens as of v0.1.1, 7 invariants, BYOL)"}]}],"id":"blk-72553","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105499","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-011-EMBODIMENT.md"},{"id":"spn-105500","text":" — Embodiment Protocol (typed perceive/act/affordances/encode_state/replay loop for "},{"id":"spn-105501","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.*"},{"id":"spn-105502","text":", InteractionTrace schema, SurpriseSignal PULSE token, 5 invariants, 12 conformance tests)"}]}],"id":"blk-72555","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105503","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION.md"},{"id":"spn-105504","text":" — Empirical Evaluation of Topology-Aware Continual Learning (Graphonomous benchmark on [&] portfolio)"}]}],"id":"blk-72557","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-72559","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105505","text":"Relationship to other projects"}]},{"id":"blk-72560","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105506","text":"OpenSentience defines the theoretical protocols; [&] portfolio companies implement them"}]}],"id":"blk-72561","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72564","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105507","text":"Graphonomous implements OS-001 (continual learning) and is the canonical PULSE substrate for "},{"id":"spn-105508","marks":["code"],"text":"memory"}]}],"id":"blk-72563","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72566","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105509","text":"AmpersandBoxDesign implements OS-002 through OS-005 as prompts and contracts"}]}],"id":"blk-72565","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105510","text":"Delegatic implements OS-006 (governance) and is the canonical PULSE substrate for "},{"id":"spn-105511","marks":["code"],"text":"policy"},{"id":"spn-105512","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-105513","marks":["code"],"text":"audit"}]}],"id":"blk-72567","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-72570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105514","text":"OS-008 (Harness) sits above OS-006 — enforces pipeline ordering, quality gates, and governance contracts at runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-72569","kind":"list-item"},{